DESCRIPTION:Uk Garage / House / Vinyl Only Datum: 30.10.2026 | Einlass: 22:00 Uhr Beginn: 22:00 | Ende: 04:30 Uhr  Free Entry Slack Hippy is a Master of his art of DJing He`s been standing behind the Decks for 36 Years and his Style\, Interpretation and Understanding of being a DJ is second to none Resident by FM4 La Boum De Luxe since 1995\, with his own show „The Dogs Bollocks" running since 1996\, he`s a master of his Craft . DJing all over Europe since the early 90ties he has built up a good reputation as a DJ who understands the Dancefloor. His concept : Dancers are the main point \, he is just the guy doing the selection. Not standing in the middle point but directing from a dark corner and letting the music flow. At Rhiz you can expect an excellent blend of House\, UKG and Breaks and if you`re lucky he might dig out some extended 80ties Classics for the early hours. His Motto: expect the unexpected.. 17.10.2026 . 23.00 – Late . Free Entry
URL:https://rhiz.wien/copilotevent/30-10-2026_slack-hippy
